      "output": "[[],[1],[2],[1,2]]",
      "explanation": "All 4 subsets of [1, 2]: empty set [], singletons [1] and [2], and pair [1, 2]. This matches the step-by-step decision tree dry run."
    }
  ],
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= nums.length <= 10",
    "-10 <= nums[i] <= 10",
    "All the numbers of nums are unique."
  ],
  "hints": [
    "At each step in recursion, you can choose to include or exclude an element.",
    "Use backtracking: append current element to path, recurse for remaining elements, then backtrack (pop).",
    "Every node visited in the decision tree represents a valid subset."
  ],
